window.products.push({"id":554192,"name":"Huoshang Projection Clock - Analogue Projection Light - Black - Arabic Numbers Clock Face","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WPRxaI8HL._AC_.jpg","description":"Note:The Plug Specification is US plug .Its feet are flat shape.It suitable for voltage 110 v, frequency 50 HZ.Input voltage:100-240V 50/60HZ 0.25A maxOutput voltage:5V 1000MAPlug standard:USA  Product Description:  This Projection Clock brings to your space a unique and stylish way to look at time. This stunning device allows the projection of a classic clock face in pure light onto any surface. It use up to date technology with an LED projector to beam to create a virtual clock face up to 6 meters away complete with sweeping second hand. The image is sharp, crisp and bright so is visible in both day and night. Comes with 3 color optics,can make the projection colorful.  Feature:  1.Projection Clock Analogue Projection Light  2.Light and shadow to build a wall clock  3.Hour, minute and second display   4.3 colour slides included- Red, Yellow and Blue,to make the projection colorful  5.Can be placed on the table or ceiling,provide a Desktop or ceiling mount.  6.The clock base perfectly match with the body , 360-degree rotating projection. 7.Low temperature cold light source,Low power consumption only 5W,durability  8.Approx 40,000 hours LED life 9.Power: 1 x AA battery for Time(not included)+ DC 5V for projector  10.Requires one AA battery (not included)  11.Projected clock face is visible during day and night  12.Would be a rather fabulous feature in the home especially the bedroom!  13.This product uses a 110V - 220V power supply  14. Size 15(H) x 12(W) x 19(D) cmPackage inlcude: 1 x LED Analogue projection Wall clock 3 x color slides  1 x mount  1 x charging adaptor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WPRxaI8HL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huoshang","source_asin":"B00JMJ14AU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JMJ14AU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JMJ14AU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":554193,"name":"Nutriblade Knife Set by Granitestone, 13 Pieces High-Grade Stainless Steel Blade Chef Kitchen Knives Set with Acrylic Block Includes 6-piece Kitchen K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZwYz65V-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER NONSTICK GRANITESTONE COATING – Nutriblade Knife Set is coated with mineral based and infused with diamonds and ensures the knives remain clean, free from rust and stains for years to come. It is non-stick so it can prevent food from sticking on the knife while slicing or chopping. RAZOR SHARP BLADES – Make slicing, chopping, dicing faster and safer with our Nutriblade knives set. It has razor sharp stainless blades for easy, precise and effortless cutting of bread, cheese, butter, vegetables, fruits, frozen meat, for all your culinary needs. COMPLETE KITCHEN SET – includes 13\" Bread Knife for cutting all types of bread like soft bread without crushing it, 13\" Santoku knife for chopping dicing & mincing, 13\" Slicer perfect for cutting slices of meats, 10\" Chef Knife designed to reduce drag while cutting delicate food stuff, 9.2\" Utility Knife for cutting cheeses, fruits & vegetables, 8\" Paring Knife ideal for peeling of fruits & veggies, 9\" fully serrated Steak Knife for cutting of steak, chicken, or fish, and black acrylic block. ERGONOMICALLY DESIGNED – Handles are rubberized for nonslip comfortable grip so you can cook, cut, slice, chop without hurting or straining your hands. DURABLE AND EASY CARE ¬– Knives are made of high-grade stainless steel blades to keep its blades spotless and for long lasting use. These are also dishwasher safe and non-stick so cleaning is a breeze.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZwYz65V-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Granitestone","source_asin":"B095WCZS6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095WCZS6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095WCZS6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":554194,"name":"Gare Saint-Lazare Arrival of a Train by Claude Monet Canvas Wall Artwork, Wood Frame, 11 by 14-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qdFZmBV0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features two trains in a station surrounded by people. Claude Monet was a founder of French impressionist painting, and the most consistent and prolific practitioner of the movement's philosophy of expressing one's perceptions before nature, especially as applied to plein-air landscape painting. Monet himself was enchanted by the vitality of outdoor settings as shown in many of his works. An 8x10 giclee print under acrylic in a 11x14 dark wood frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a dark wooden frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional frames and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qdFZmBV0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00DV683TU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DV683TU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DV683TU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
