window.products.push({"id":554204,"name":"Cheer Collection 4\" Folding Futon Mattress, Tri-Fold Design for Compact Storage with Soft Bamboo Washable Cover- Foldable Sleeping Pad/Floor Mattress ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":103.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xCX9-AQCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE MOST PRACTICAL, SPACE-SAVING, TRI-FOLD FUTON MATTRESS: The Cheer Collection folding futon mattress features a smart tri-fold design that allows you to easily store the pad when not in use. Perfect even for small homes and dorm rooms, this floor mattress is all you need to have an extra bed in hand whenever and wherever needed! ULTRA-COMFORTABLE SLEEPING FLOOR PAD FOR UNINTERRUPTED ZZZ: Made of thick, dense and extra high-quality foam materials, your new bed mattress topper will grant you a deep and peaceful sleeping experience every single time. Durable enough to comfortably support any kid or adult, this foldable mattress is the best way to accommodate any family member, guests or overnight visitors! DREAMY SOFT & BREATHABLE REMOVABLE BAMBOO COVER: This amazing sleeping pad mattress comes with a removable and machine washable cover for easy care. The superior quality bamboo cover is ultra-soft, breathable, and naturally resistant to skin-irritating agents, making it the safest choice for the whole family, even for those with skin sensitivities. Ideal for all-year-round use too! EXTREMELY PORTABLE & CONVENIENT FOR HOME AND TRAVEL USE: Thanks to its compact and lightweight design with handles, you can effortlessly pack and carry this portable sleeping mattress with you on any of your travels. Perfect to use on the floor of any room as well as for camping, camper vans, overnight family stays, road-trips and any other outdoor adventure AVAILABLE IN 2 COMFORTABLE SIZES FOR KIDS, ADULTS & MORE: This innovative tri-fold futon mattress comes in 2 handy sizes: 75\" x 31\" x 4\" and 75\" x 31\" x 4\" to find the best match for your needs. Plus, you can fold this versatile mattress in two, to use it as a DIY sofa, armchair or playmat for your kiddo – the possibilities are endless!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xCX9-AQCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheer Collection","source_asin":"B07JGBRHB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JGBRHB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JGBRHB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
