window.products.push({"id":554209,"name":"Dream Logix Talalay Natural Latex Pillow-Side Back & Stomach Sleepers, Medium Firm for Back, Helps Relieve Shoulder & Neck Pain, Spine Support (Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mOhvKgkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxurious Natural Materials: talalay latex foam pillow products are produced from natural latex that is derived from sustainable and renewable rubber tree plantations. Our pillows support your head and neck to provide the best sleep for adults and kids. Each pillow is enclosed in a thin and soft, 100% cotton case. Healthy and Convenient: the natural latex plush pillows conform to your body during sleep and return to their original shape after using. The pillows fit standard, queen and king-sized beds and accompany any bedding. They are great to travel and can wedge perfectly between you and a seat or sleeper. Perfect for stomach, side, and back sleepers, our pillows will help you sleep like a baby. Talalay technology provides a smart, breathable structure with optimal air flow to keep you cool at night. International Certification: our New York based company is dedicated to practicing responsible and sustainable development philosophies. We carefully observe each step of the production process to guarantee that our products pass the maximum level of safety. Soft and Supportive: Natural latex is soft, yet supportive at the same time. Unlike other bedding materials, latex provides optimal support to the natural curvature of your spine when sleeping, maximizing your dreams all night long. Easy Care: Latex pillows are easy to care for as they can be hand-washed. Our 100% cotton pillowcases can be removed and machine washed at your convenience. Lifetime Investment: Natural latex pillows are a great investment as they keep their shape for years. They don’t need to be replaced as often as an ordinary pillow and provide optimal support unlike any other material.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mOhvKgkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dream Logix Healthy Sleep Solutions","source_asin":"B0BKPSCFGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKPSCFGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKPSCFGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
