window.products.push({"id":554254,"name":"Pumpkin Walnut Cheesecake Soy Votive Candles - Scented with Natural Fragrance Oils - 6 Beige Natural Votive Candle Refills - Bakery & Food Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jvkw077DL._AC_SL1244_.jpg","description":"Rich pumpkin and cream cheese are spiced just right then topped with a delicious walnut caramel crunch and a touch of warm cinnamon maple butter. Our Soy based Pumpkin Walnut Cheesecake Votive Candles feature a self trimming natural fiber wick, and should use 100% of the wax when burned properly while giving off a pleasant scent throw. Designed for use in tight fitting traditional votive containers only, do not burn without a votive holder/container. Our natural hard wax is composed of a moldable, soy wax blend, which allows us to add a good amount of fragrance to each candle without the fragrance bleeding out while maintaining a rigid shape. Our soy wax blend also features a low melting point making for a faster melt and good scent throw.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jvkw077DL._AC_SL1244_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shortie's Candle Company","source_asin":"B01ASNSPOQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ASNSPOQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ASNSPOQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
