window.products.push({"id":554305,"name":"Total Pillow, Microbead Pillow, Adjustable Pillow for Neck and Lumbar Support","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711wyB4HKFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of stiff, aching muscles? Discover true relief when you use the amazing and versatile Total Pillow by Hampton Direct. This pillow is conveniently adjustable to give you ultimate comfort. It can help prevent cricks in your neck, sore lumbar muscles, and more! This pillow is made from soft brushed fleece and spandex, so it will feel nice and comfy against your skin. It is stuffed with millions of tension-easing 100% polystyrene microbeads. The microbeads conform to the contours of your body, providing a natural space for you to rest on. This pillow can fold, twist, and contort into several different positions. Use it as a traditional pillow, chair cushion, neck rest, or for lumbar support. This pillow’s adjustable contoured shape is perfect for traveling. You can use it on flights and road trips — just as long as you’re the passenger! Its basic shape and standard size are acceptable for most airlines as a personal item. Bring this pillow with you on your next flight or road trip. Its petal shape also makes it quite portable. The pillow fits over the handle of suitcases, clips onto backpacks, and hooks onto your arm for easy travel. You don’t have to use it for just traveling; it can also be used as a great asset in the home. It makes a great gift, so give it to someone who is always on the go or gift it to an older person. This is the original Total Pillow by Hampton Direct. We use superior material to make our pillows, giving you the best pillow available. Order it today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711wyB4HKFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Total Pillow","source_asin":"B01N7UDAQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7UDAQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N7UDAQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":554306,"name":"Willow Tree Lots of Love Ornament, Sculpted Hand-Painted Figure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IvuBhTy+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Sentiment: ”Ever close to my heart” written on hangtag 4.5”h hand-painted resin ornament of figure in cream dress, holding a thin wire concentric heart in hands. Wire heart is dusted with gold glitter. Ornaments are smaller-sized versions of the most-loved Willow Tree angels and figures, with brown elastic cord for hanging. For Holidays or for Everyday, Ornaments are gifts for engagements, weddings, new babies, graduations, teachers, birthdays... an expression of love and appreciation that celebrates life's milestones in a small, commemorative format. Packaged in fitted box ready for gift-giving. Artist Susan Lordi hand carves the original of each Willow Tree piece from her studio in Kansas City, MO. This piece is cast based on Susan's original carving and painted by hand. Brown elastic cord for hanging. To clean, dust with soft brush or cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IvuBhTy+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Willow Tree","source_asin":"B01GS723A8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GS723A8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GS723A8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
