window.products.push({"id":554371,"name":"Alpine Cuisine Nonstick Round Comal 9.5-Inch - Black Carbon Steel Tortilla Comal with Double Handle - Durable, Heavy Duty Comal for Cooking - Even-Hea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Bs9mfVQXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL & UNIQUE DESIGN: Our frying Comal is made of high-quality carbon steel and heavy-duty material that passes the test of time. What makes this accessory special is its thickness, which makes it more durable and reliable. This round Comal is designed to help you prepare super-tasty tortillas the way they should be done. EASY TO USE: Unlike similar accessories, our kitchen comal griddle nonstick has a riveted side Double handle that is easy to use and durable, allowing you to maneuver this Mexican Comal easily. The gauge reaches very high temperatures much more easily than other pans, so it is recommended that you cook using low to medium heat. MULTIPURPOSE ACCESSORY: Although our high-quality comal is ideal for preparing authentic tortillas and quesadillas, our carbon steel oval comal on gas stove cooking is also an excellent option roasting spices and vegetables, making crepes, toasting sandwiches, cooking quesadillas, and all your favorite breakfast foods. This flat comal tortilla pan comes in a 9.5-inch size that allows you to prepare several tortillas. EASY MAINTENANCE: Using a scrubbing pad, clean the comal pan with hot water and detergent to keep the pan's beautiful polished appearance. Immediately dry it with a soft cloth and store it in a dry and safe place to prevent rusting. This long-lasting and convenient multi-purpose tortilla comal pan is an excellent gift for birthdays, weddings, housewarmings, or any occasion. 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: We want our customers to be completely happy and satisfied, so we pack each Carbon Steel non-stick Comal with care. If you have any questions or concerns about the product, please feel free to reach out to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Bs9mfVQXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpine Cuisine","source_asin":"B0BLY25C7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLY25C7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLY25C7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
