window.products.push({"id":554402,"name":"24-Piece Black Silverware Set with Steak Knives, Seolmae Unique Flower Design Stainless Steel Flatware Cutlery Set, Include Textured Fork Spoon Knife ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tqz5xWvJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【24 Pieces Black Silverware Set for 4 】-Seolmae24 black silverware set includes 4 dinner knives, 4 dinner forks, 4 dinner spoons, 4 salad forks, 4 teaspoons and 4 steak knives. The set is extensive, so it's enough to host a party or a weeknight dinner.Perfect for the daily use and the reserve for special occasions. 【One-of-A-Kind Design】- This black silver tableware with a steak knife is particularly ornate and features a beautiful floral laser print. It is made of exquisite workmanship and stands out among ordinary silverware. The style is also paired with a black finish, which adds a touch of elegant and luxurious dining to your table. It also brings a unique atmosphere to Christmas. 【High Quality Cutlery】- Seolmae black cutlery is made of food-grade high-quality 304 stainless steel, which is effective against rust and corrosion, and is not easy to breed harmful substances. High hardness material, not easy to bend or chip, strong and durable, suitable for daily use, easy to clean, dishwasher safe. Please do not use wire brushes, hard sponges or other hard material cleaning tools to avoid scratching the silverware and ensure that the surface is smooth. 【Nice Workmanship】- Unique Stainless Steel Flatware Cutlery Set Workmanship has a smooth edge that will not cut your fingers to ensure safety. In addition, its ergonomically curved handle design provides a good grip for adults and big kids alike, and each appliance is sturdy, well-balanced and comfortable to use. 【Steak Knife Included】-In this cutlery set, we have 4 additional steak knives with sharp serrations, making it easy to slice steak or disassemble Turkey. The triple riveted handle is sturdy and very comfortable to hold. Especially suitable for family gatherings, party dinners, weddings, Christmas parties, to meet all your use scenarios.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tqz5xWvJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seolmae","source_asin":"B0BJ7J9JWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ7J9JWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ7J9JWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
