window.products.push({"id":554415,"name":"C.R. Gibson Jewelry Pouch, Rapture by Iota Chic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s7m+WPebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fashion. Function. Fabulousness. At home or out and about, beautiful iota chic accessories grace your life. Satin-lined pouch organizes and protects jewelry on the go. Features 8 small pockets and 1 large pocket. Secure drawstring closure. Bold charcoal gray and green floral pattern. Welcome to the colorful, carefree spirit of iota, where the belief is that color is a choice - an attitude, a personal adventure into self expression. A lively mix of paper and textile-driven products in a variety of unique categories: baby and women's accessories, social stationery, eco-fashionable totes, kitchen collections, tabletop and gift items. Whether buying iota for oneself or giving it as a gift, both are joyful acts of defiance against the humdrum, the ordinary, the colorless. C.R. Gibson is pleased to bring you the colorful spark of iota, where it's always about the little things, where every iota makes a difference. When you want the best in party and giftware, trust C.R. Gibson, synonymous with quality for more than 140 years. Starting with the creation of the very first baby book in 1898, families around the world have depended on C.R. Gibson as their number one provider of products that celebrate life's most cherished moments. Today you'll not only find baby books and photo albums, you'll also find a wide choice of party supplies, gift ideas and little luxuries to make your life easier. Understanding the importance of design and craftsmanship, all C.R. Gibson products offer a tradition of quality that highlights classic styling as well as today's top fashions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s7m+WPebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.R. Gibson","source_asin":"B00JFARKHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JFARKHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JFARKHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
