window.products.push({"id":554437,"name":"Dish-Wish Drying Matt Large Woven Cotton and Terrycloth Double Sided 14 x 20","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hrK0UTD6L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"\"Absorbing Mat The ideal way to keep kitchen counters tidy and beautiful. Replaces wet unsightly dish towels. Free your kitchen of soggy, unappealing dish towels that don't dry utensils properly and need to be changed daily. Super-absorbent mat works better and faster than any dish towel. A Few Words about Kitchen Towels, Relationships in Crisis and Unexpected Solutions DishWish came into this world as a result of a crisis in our relationship with the dishtowel. This is about that same old towel lying on the counter, soaking wet and helpless, waiting to absorb the remaining drops of water from the hand washed dishes. Despite the likely presence of a dishwasher that can clean nearly everything, there is always that pan, that pot, and those glasses that have been hand washed and placed on the counter, on that famous towel, doing its limited best to absorb the water. And so, the poor kitchen towel finds itself working long, wet hours in the wrong profession - overworked, neither looking nor smelling good, wrinkled and full of guilt. Don?t take it personally, towel; it's not you, it?s us! And then someone said: \"\"This can't be right. There must be a better solution.\"\" And so next to the sink, on the kitchen counter, the DishWish ?Absorbing Mat was born. Designed to fit into every kitchen, the mat absorbs the water leaving dishes, mat and counter dry. Unlike its predecessor, the dishtowel, the mat doesn't have to be replaced every day, and there is no unpleasant odor. You can just hang him up to dry. He washes and dries easily in your washing machine and is ready in an instant to return to his duty. Rumor has it that the DishWish Absorbing Mat is ready to work in your kitchen too! \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hrK0UTD6L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dish-Wish","source_asin":"B00GVXE96G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GVXE96G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GVXE96G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":554438,"name":"Papo \"Pirate with Gun Figure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lHQRLvdfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For almost 20 years now, Papo has been helping younger and older children to develop and to discover the world around them. Childhood is a time of dreams and adventures, and this was what we had in mind when we decided to create the first princesses, princes, dragons and Knights. Thanks to the originality of its products and the extreme care taken with product quality and safety, over the years Papo has proved popular with children and their parents. Today a reference in the world of 39423 figures, Papo continues to develop new ranges to inspire the imaginations of children the world over. In an age of mass consumption and throwaway goods, Papo remains true to its wish to produce fine toys which last over time and which can be passed on from generation to generation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lHQRLvdfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Papo","source_asin":"B000B8YLBA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000B8YLBA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000B8YLBA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":554439,"name":"breathe-zy Anti Suffocation Epilepsy Pillow - Breathable with Memory Foam Insert for Extra Comfort & Support","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Yi6WGZ0GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Carousel Care would like to introduce the Breathe-zy Anti-Suffocation Pillow. A Class 1 Medical Device which is designed to be breathable, practical and comfortable, whilst assisting in the prevention of SUDEP. The outer cover is made from innovative three dimensional fabric. The cover consists of two pieces of soft mesh fabric, joined 10mm apart with strands of polyester fibre creating a ‘wall of air’ that won’t crush when depressed. The cover is filled with two fibre pads, each are encased in an open weave mesh fabric. Between these two pads is a memory foam insert which provides a ‘crown’ effect offering greater comfort. The cover is fully removable, and is machine washable. The major advantage of our design is that the whole of the surface of the pillow is breathable, not just certain areas. This ensures that at all times regardless of your sleeping style, you are always in a safe and secure position. Our innovative design has been registered as a CLASS 1 MEDICAL DEVICE with the Medicines and Healthcare Products Regulatory Agency. The Medicines and Healthcare Products Regulatory Agency (MHRA) is an executive agency of the Department of Health in the United Kingdom which is responsible for ensuring that medicines and medical devices work and are acceptably safe. This product is an aid to epilepsy and not a cure and is in no way intended to replace medical care or attention by a qualified practitioner. We strongly advise all users with health problems to consult a doctor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Yi6WGZ0GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"breathe-zy","source_asin":"B00WUEPGIK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WUEPGIK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WUEPGIK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
