window.products.push({"id":554523,"name":"Royal Decanters Etched Globe Whiskey Decanter Gift Set- Glasses & Glass Beverage Drink Dispenser also for Brandy Tequila Bourbon Scotch Rum -Alcohol R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418uRMkGM2L._AC_.jpg","description":"LOVE IT OR YOUR MONEY BACK AND LIFETIME WARRANTY - Everyone who gets our patent pending set as a gift absolutely loves it! But if you don’t like it for any reason simply contact us for a full refund. ARTISAN CRAFTED - This elegant lead free skull decanter is entirely hand made. From the hand crafted wood stand to the hand-blown skull shaped glass decanter and shot glasses to the wooden base of each matching bar glass - we pay attention to each detail so that each set can display beautifully in your home/bar. BAR SUPPLIES SET - With a large 850mL decanter & 4 bar glasses this glassware set is a great start or finishing touch for home bars that you can display proudly and serve guests with. Makes a great alcohol related gift for the person who just has everything! PRESERVES FRESHNESS - A fitted glass stopper seals the decanter for ideal storage, keeping your favorite beverage flavorful and aromatic. Everyone will comment on this tabletop liquor or wine holder and display for cozy home decor. LARGE PATENT PENDING DECANTER: 850 mL capacity, enough to hold the contents of a standard wine bottle as well as most bottles of scotch, rum and hard liquors / spirits so that you can open a bottle and pour out the entire contents easily into the decanter. Makes a great and unique alternative to crystal decanters. IF PURCHASING AS A GIFT PLEASE SELECT \"CONCEAL PACKAGE\" AT CHECKOUT FOR AMAZON TO SHIP OUR DECANTER IN A SEPARATE BOX","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418uRMkGM2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Decanters","source_asin":"B07FFGPLGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FFGPLGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FFGPLGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
