window.products.push({"id":554536,"name":"Mini Heart with Wings and Bird, Soulmate Heart Collection, Take your Worry Away, Angel Wings, Flying, Love and Friendship 5 x 5.25 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913S+Os18eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Milagro is the Spanish word for “miracles.” Milagros are small metal charms that come in a wide variety of shapes. These hearts with wings are fashioned after milagros and might be offered in thanks for a new love or the passion that still flames after many years. This is a hand-crafted original piece of Haitian metal art, made from recycled steel drums and brought to you through fair trade practices. A small nail will be sufficient to hang this piece from the tiny hole provided. Natural color variations from dark silver to brown rustic tones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913S+Os18eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"It's Cactus","source_asin":"B076DLG67G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076DLG67G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076DLG67G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":554537,"name":"SAIKO NO 8 Inch Knife – 8 Inch Chef Knife with Sheath and Gift Box – Ultra Sharp VG10 Japanese Steel 8in Chef Knife – 8 Inch Kitchen Knife – 8 Inch Ja","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6172ziHP7+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAIKO NO 8 INCH KNIFE – prepare your favorite recipes with ultimate precision using the Saiko No 8in chef knife! Made from premium quality materials including Japanese VG10 steel, and with a cutting core at 58-60 HRC this is a robust, sharp knife which is designed to withstand the test of time, even with regular use JAPANESE VG-10 STEEL 8 INCH KITCHEN KNIFE – perfect for both home cooks and professional chefs, this 8 inch Japanese chef knife is made from Japanese VG-10 steel which is a high-carbon steel that holds its super-sharp edge longer than stainless steel, for ultimate durability and ease when chopping, dicing, and slicing! ERGONOMICALLY DESIGNED 8 INCH KNIFE – this ultra-sharp 8in chef knife features an ergonomically designed handle which is comfortable to hold, giving you ultimate control while preparing fruit, vegetables, meat, fish and more EASY CARE 8 INCH JAPANESE CHEF KNIFE – designed to be used for dicing, mincing, chopping, and slicing, this versatile 8 inch chef knife is an essential for every home or professional kitchen. Taking care of your 8 inch kitchen knife is easy – simply wash in hot, soapy water, rinse and leave to air dry – ready for its next use in no time! 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE – we are highly confident in the premium quality of the Saiko No 8 inch chef knife! If you have any issues with your purchase, please contact us directly, within 30 days, so that we can solve the problem swiftly for you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6172ziHP7+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAIKO NO","source_asin":"B09P9NW8HD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P9NW8HD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P9NW8HD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":554538,"name":"Bear on Hill Statue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5136FNcEkRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This excellent example of the past two years in the market makes a good reminder of the hard times you have overcome. Great for any Wall Street office, this bear walking downhill on slippery rocks is shown in great detail. 9\"Wx9.5\"H Bear These sculptures are made using a bronze electro-plating process. The result is a fine sculpture with great detail and high quality for less than half the price of solid bronze.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5136FNcEkRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marian Imports","source_asin":"B0051UK04A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0051UK04A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0051UK04A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":554539,"name":"nuLOOM Minnie Coastal Starfish Accent Rug, 2' x 3', Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Qq7jwT4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At nuLOOM, we believe that floor coverings and art should not be mutually exclusive. Founded with a desire to break the rules of what is expected from an area rug, nuLOOM was created to fill the void between brilliant design and affordability., The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Qq7jwT4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B0B6KTJ91S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6KTJ91S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6KTJ91S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
