window.products.push({"id":554847,"name":"JUMMICO Farmhouse TV Stand for 65 Inch TV, Mid Century Modern Entertainment Center with Sliding Barn Doors and Storage Cabinets, Metal Media TV Consol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZT5MKfD5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Farmhouse Style TV stand] This media console cabinet can be used as a TV stand to support flat screen TVs up to 65\", suitable for most home TV placement. If you like, it can also serve as a storage cabinet to show your family photos and potted plants. [Sliding Barn Doors] Two movable barn doors on the TV stand for convenient access to cabinets. Quality steel bar make doors slide smoothly, and no noise during movement. Two sliding barn door design to conceal side storage cabinets or center storage shelves. [Sturdy and Durable Structure] Made from high-grade certified manufactured wood frame. Made of high quality decorative laminate, the top board has good toughness and is difficult to deform. Feel assured to place your TV on this TV stand and enjoy your leisure time. [Sufficient Storage Space] This TV stand console comes with 2 cabinets of storage space and 2 open spaces in the barn doors on both sides with 3 levels of adjustable and removable shelves, providing abundant storage or display space for CDs, DVDs, game boxes, decorative items and more. The spacious tabletop supports 40, 43, 50, 55, 60, and 65 inch TV. [Relieved by Easy Assembly] This TV console table comes with numbered parts and clear instructions, you can quickly install the TV stand in little time. If you are in contact with the TV cabinet for the first time, it is recommended that two people assemble it correctly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZT5MKfD5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUMMICO","source_asin":"B0BLVHY3C9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLVHY3C9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLVHY3C9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":554848,"name":"Yoshihiro Hayate Inox Aus-8 Petty Utility Japanese Chefs Knife Integrated Stainless Handle (3.2'' (80mm))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519y3fgdBiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sometimes called a utility knife, the Petty is a smaller version of chefs knife but is bigger than a paring knife. The Petty fits in small places that require more dexterity than bigger chefs knives while handling bigger jobs than a paring knife can take care of. A razor sharp Petty knife can intricately carve and style vegetables and fruits for beautiful presentations and garnishes, performing just as well for bigger jobs such as preparing meals. Our Yoshihiro Hayate Inox Aus-8 Petty Japanese Chefs Knife features a traditional Japanese convex grind (Hamaguri-ba). This is the same grind that was utilized in Japanese sword making and it excels in sharpness, durability and ease of sharpening. Forged from a single piece of high carbon Aus-8 stainless steel, this knife is complemented by an integrated hollow stainless steel handle that is molded for comfort and ribbed for safe grip. It is welded directly onto the blade to make for a durable, long lasting knife that is also easy to clean and sanitary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519y3fgdBiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoshihiro","source_asin":"B08H5X29WP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5X29WP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H5X29WP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
