window.products.push({"id":554865,"name":"5ML Portable Bottom Refillable Perfume Atomizer Spray Perfume Bottle Set for Travel (4) (Kit1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715pexEuRbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PORTABLE TRAVEL ATOMIZER - colorful, mini size & easy refill, Fragrance bottles were not made for travel so we developed this refillable, travel sized atomizer to make your favorite scent available wherever you may go.  Cute colorful cool refillable atomizers, they're small and can easily fit in a clutch purse or pocket. No more dragging around big perfume bottles in your pocketbook during travel. Match the color with your perfume or cologne bottle, too, so you can easily identify which fragrance you want to take with you Extremely useful for frequent flyers. TSA doesn't allow carry-on liquid more than 100ml per bottle. With this, you can carry your cosmetics onboard instead check in your package. Best idea for taking your favorite Cologne/Perfume on vacation etc., instead of using the original bottle and of course adding extra carry weight. COLORS: Black/ Metallic Gold/ Metallic Silver/ Metallic Blue CAPACITY: 5 ml / 70 sprays AIRCRAFT APPROVED (TSA) HOW TO REFILL: √√√ Remove the top of pump from Fragrance Bottle √√√ Insert nozzle into valve at base of atomizer. Pump up and down firmly until full. Do not over fill.  √√√ Remove lid and spray. ATTENTION: √√√ Do not subject to high temperatures or low pressures, which may cause leaking.  √√√ May not be compatible with non-standard spray heads  √√√ Do not over fill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715pexEuRbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"4PA","source_asin":"B078W3Z2FQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078W3Z2FQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078W3Z2FQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
