window.products.push({"id":554949,"name":"Pillivuyt Porcelain Small 1-Quart, 10-1/2-by-6-Inch Octagonal Roaster","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21VNXEN3TCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description One of Pillivuyt's proudest accomplishments is their development of some exceptionally attractive and unique shapes. Aside from their high quality glaze, which is impermeable and stays beautiful for the life of the dish, these octagonal dishes are a perfect complement to fine china dinnerware. The octagonal dishes make a graceful and elegant presentation, yet they are sturdy and durable, resistant to chipping and scratching, and can withstand all the daily wear-and-tear of the dishwasher, the oven, the microwave, or the freezer. These are a shallower dish, making them suitable for gratins and crisp-top casseroles or great for roasting vegetables, which will brown perfectly on the evenly heated surface that Pillivuyt dishes provide. The 10 1/2 x 6 inch octagonal has a 1 quart capacity and is suitable for baked appetizer dips or smaller hors d'oeuvre presentations. For cold appetizers, chill your dish before filling it with crudites or other appetizers and they will stay cool for a longer time. Amazon.com Ideally shaped for roasting and baking gratins or foods that require browning on the top, this 10-1/2-by-6-inch roasting pan has shallow, flared sides that direct most of the heat to the larger surface area on the top of the dish. The thin, even walls on this dish provide the ideal heat conduction and enable the dish to retain its heat at the table. An exquisite specimen of fine French pottery, this porcelain roasting dish is a milky white color and has squared corners giving it an elegant octagonal shape. This 1-quart size is appropriate for baking and serving a hot seafood dip appetizer or a side dish of creamy cauliflower and carrot gratin for two. The roaster's shape also lends itself well to being used as a serving tray for heated miniature crabcakes or chilled petit fours. Family-founded in 1818, the Pillivuyt porcelain factory still employs skilled artisans who use the proprietary porcelain recipe and the original time-honored traditions of handcrafting each piece. Replacement molds are all handmade by craftspeople who have spent many years in training, and who shape them to the level of perfection that this superior bakeware requires. The result is a tough porcelain base that can withstand temperature extremes, making this baker safe to move among the oven, freezer, microwave, or broiler. And, with a little liquid in the baker, the pan can even be placed over a diffused flame on the stovetop. All pieces are glazed and fired at temperatures of about 2,500 degrees Fahrenheit, which produces a non-porous, rock-hard finish that easily cleans up by hand or in the dishwasher. The lead-free glaze is resistant to crazing and staining and won't absorb food odors or flavors. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21VNXEN3TCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pillivuyt","source_asin":"B0006TJ786","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-554949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006TJ786","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006TJ786","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
